---
---

<section class="card featured-card" id="featured-projects">
  <div class="card-header-row">
    <h2>
      <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="title-icon">
        <polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon>
      </svg>
      Featured & Flagship Projects
    </h2>
    <span class="section-eyebrow">Curated Engineering Showcase</span>
  </div>

  <p class="section-intro">
    A curated portfolio of systems and tools designed to solve high-friction bottlenecks in autonomous agent cognition, codebase navigation, and edge infrastructure.
  </p>

  <!-- Flagship Section: Primary Case Studies -->
  <div class="flagship-container">
    <!-- Project 1: Veyra -->
    <article class="flagship-item flagship-primary">
      <div class="flagship-top">
        <div class="flagship-badges">
          <span class="pill-badge pill-flagship">Flagship Project</span>
          <span class="pill-badge pill-tech">Epistemic Memory</span>
          <span class="pill-badge pill-status">v0.7.0 Production</span>
        </div>
        <span class="repo-meta">Open Source · DSH Native Plugin</span>
      </div>

      <h3 class="flagship-title">
        <a href="/projects/veyra">Veyra — Engineering Intelligence for Coding Agents</a>
      </h3>

      <p class="flagship-desc">
        Solves the coding-agent trust crisis and context amnesia through a <strong>Dual-Brain epistemic architecture</strong>. Strictly separates authoritative repository truth (git history, live code, passing tests) from learned engineering memory (causal facets, negative lessons, and trust decay).
      </p>

      <div class="capabilities-box">
        <span class="cap-header">Core Architectural Capabilities</span>
        <ul class="cap-list">
          <li><strong>Dual-Brain Truth Separation:</strong> Live repository code and tests remain absolute ground truth; memory serves as advisory historical guidance.</li>
          <li><strong>Three-Axis Epistemic Model:</strong> Authority (<code>candidate → derived → canonical</code>), Validation (<code>unverified → reviewed → verified</code>), and Confidence.</li>
          <li><strong>Read-Time Trust Projection:</strong> Dynamic classification against git repository state (<code>trusted</code>, <code>review_required</code>, <code>stale</code>, <code>contradicted</code>, <code>insufficient_evidence</code>).</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="project-footer">
        <div class="stack-tags">
          <span>Node.js (ESM)</span>
          <span>node:sqlite</span>
          <span>FTS5 Search</span>
          <span>DeepSeek Harness</span>
          <span>MCP Bridge</span>
        </div>
        <div class="project-actions">
          <a href="/projects/veyra" class="btn-action btn-study">
            <span>Technical Case Study</span>
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
              <polyline points="12 5 19 12 19 19"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a href="https://github.com/LoveDoLove/Veyra" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-action btn-gh">
            GitHub
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Project 2: dsh-codebase-memory-mcp -->
    <article class="flagship-item flagship-secondary">
      <div class="flagship-top">
        <div class="flagship-badges">
          <span class="pill-badge pill-graph">Codebase Intelligence</span>
          <span class="pill-badge pill-tech">MCP Bridge</span>
          <span class="pill-badge pill-status">v0.1.10 Plugin</span>
        </div>
        <span class="repo-meta">DeepSeek Harness Plugin</span>
      </div>

      <h3 class="flagship-title">
        <a href="/projects/dsh-codebase-memory-mcp">dsh-codebase-memory-mcp — Code Graph Bridge</a>
      </h3>

      <p class="flagship-desc">
        Model Context Protocol (MCP) bridge bringing <strong>structural AST code knowledge graphs</strong> to DeepSeek Harness. Replaces unstructured grep searches with deterministic symbol discovery, call-graph tracing, and blast-radius analysis.
      </p>

      <div class="capabilities-box">
        <span class="cap-header">Core Architectural Capabilities</span>
        <ul class="cap-list">
          <li><strong>6 Native Graph Tools:</strong> Direct access to <code>cbm_trace</code>, <code>cbm_search</code>, <code>cbm_snippet</code>, <code>cbm_arch</code>, <code>cbm_search_code</code>, and <code>cbm_projects</code>.</li>
          <li><strong>System Prompt Heuristics:</strong> Injects decision rules guiding agents to prefer structural graph exploration over flat file reading.</li>
          <li><strong>Autonomous Daemon Lifecycle:</strong> Automatic background server orchestration, health monitoring on <code>:9749</code>, and graceful degradation.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="project-footer">
        <div class="stack-tags">
          <span>Node.js (ESM)</span>
          <span>Model Context Protocol</span>
          <span>AST Code Graph</span>
          <span>DeepSeek Harness</span>
          <span>Web UI (:9749)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="project-actions">
          <a href="/projects/dsh-codebase-memory-mcp" class="btn-action btn-study">
            <span>Technical Case Study</span>
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
              <polyline points="12 5 19 12 19 19"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a href="https://github.com/LoveDoLove/dsh-codebase-memory-mcp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-action btn-gh">
            GitHub
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <!-- Secondary Projects Grid: Edge & Systems -->
  <div class="secondary-header">
    <h3>Edge Infrastructure & Systems Engineering</h3>
    <span class="secondary-subtitle">Production edge workers, network tools, and UNIX services</span>
  </div>

  <div class="projects-grid">
    <!-- Project 3: cloudflare-load-balancer -->
    <div class="project-mini-card">
      <div class="mini-top">
        <span class="pill-badge pill-edge">Edge Routing</span>
        <a href="https://github.com/LoveDoLove/cloudflare-load-balancer" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mini-link">
          GitHub ↗
        </a>
      </div>
      <h4 class="mini-title">
        <a href="https://github.com/LoveDoLove/cloudflare-load-balancer" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          cloudflare-load-balancer
        </a>
      </h4>
      <p>
        Cloudflare Worker-based geo-steering multi-origin load balancer. Features background health checking, latency-aware geographical routing, automatic failover, and low-latency serverless edge execution.
      </p>
      <div class="mini-footer">
        <div class="mini-tags">
          <span>Cloudflare Workers</span>
          <span>JavaScript</span>
          <span>Geo-Steering</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Project 4: cloudflare-smart-cache -->
    <div class="project-mini-card">
      <div class="mini-top">
        <span class="pill-badge pill-edge">Edge Performance</span>
        <a href="https://github.com/LoveDoLove/cloudflare-smart-cache" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mini-link">
          GitHub ↗
        </a>
      </div>
      <h4 class="mini-title">
        <a href="https://github.com/LoveDoLove/cloudflare-smart-cache" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          cloudflare-smart-cache
        </a>
      </h4>
      <p>
        Intelligent edge caching engine for Cloudflare Workers. Implements stale-while-revalidate, dynamic cache-tag invalidation, bypass rules, and cache-hit analytics.
      </p>
      <div class="mini-footer">
        <div class="mini-tags">
          <span>Cloudflare Workers</span>
          <span>Cache API</span>
          <span>SWR Caching</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Project 5: cf-best-domain -->
    <div class="project-mini-card">
      <div class="mini-top">
        <span class="pill-badge pill-net">Network Intelligence</span>
        <a href="https://github.com/LoveDoLove/cf-best-domain" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mini-link">
          GitHub ↗
        </a>
      </div>
      <h4 class="mini-title">
        <a href="https://github.com/LoveDoLove/cf-best-domain" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          cf-best-domain
        </a>
      </h4>
      <p>
        Cloudflare speed-test intelligence CLI tool. Tests and ranks Cloudflare Anycast CDN IP endpoints by latency and packet loss, automatically selecting optimal routes.
      </p>
      <div class="mini-footer">
        <div class="mini-tags">
          <span>Shell / CLI</span>
          <span>Anycast CDN</span>
          <span>Network Testing</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Project 6: alist-freebsd -->
    <div class="project-mini-card">
      <div class="mini-top">
        <span class="pill-badge pill-sys">UNIX Systems</span>
        <a href="https://github.com/LoveDoLove/alist-freebsd" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mini-link">
          GitHub ↗
        </a>
      </div>
      <h4 class="mini-title">
        <a href="https://github.com/LoveDoLove/alist-freebsd" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          alist-freebsd
        </a>
      </h4>
      <p>
        FreeBSD service port and daemon package for AList. Implements native FreeBSD rc.d init scripts, automated service lifecycle management, and clean user isolation.
      </p>
      <div class="mini-footer">
        <div class="mini-tags">
          <span>FreeBSD</span>
          <span>rc.d Init</span>
          <span>Shell</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .featured-card {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .title-icon {
    color: var(--accent-light);
  }

  .section-intro {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .flagship-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .flagship-item {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 24px;
    transition: all 0.25s ease;
    position: relative;
  }

  .flagship-primary {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
  }

  .flagship-secondary {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  .flagship-item:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035);
    border-color: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.35);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .flagship-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .flagship-badges {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .pill-badge {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .pill-flagship { background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15); color: var(--accent-light); }
  .pill-graph { background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.15); color: var(--accent-cyan); }
  .pill-tech { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); color: var(--muted); }
  .pill-status { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12); color: var(--accent-emerald); }
  .pill-edge { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12); color: #fbbf24; }
  .pill-net { background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.12); color: #60a5fa; }
  .pill-sys { background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12); color: #c084fc; }

  .repo-meta {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--dim);
  }

  .flagship-title {
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }

  .flagship-title a {
    color: var(--text);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .flagship-title a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  .flagship-desc {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .flagship-desc strong {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .capabilities-box {
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .cap-header {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--dim);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .cap-list {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 18px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .cap-list li strong {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .project-footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 14px;
    padding-top: 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
  }

  .stack-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .stack-tags span {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    color: var(--muted);
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .project-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .btn-action {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-study {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .btn-study:hover {
    background: var(--accent-light);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .btn-gh {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .btn-gh:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  /* Secondary Grid */
  .secondary-header {
    margin: 32px 0 16px;
  }

  .secondary-header h3 {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 4px;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .secondary-subtitle {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--dim);
  }

  .projects-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .project-mini-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 18px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .project-mini-card:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .mini-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .mini-link {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--dim);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .mini-link:hover {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  .mini-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .mini-title a {
    color: var(--text);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .mini-title a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  .project-mini-card p {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .mini-footer {
    margin-top: 8px;
    padding-top: 10px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
  }

  .mini-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .mini-tags span {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: var(--dim);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .projects-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .flagship-top {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .project-footer {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
  }
</style>
